<h3>Welcome to the Middlesex County College Digital Collections</h3>

<p>The&nbsp;Middlesex County College digital repository (MCCDC)&nbsp;houses&nbsp;both the scholarly and creative&nbsp;output of faculty and students&nbsp;along with historical materials of the College held in its Archives.&nbsp;</p>

<h2>Historical Collections</h2>

<p>Historical materials encompass&nbsp;the College&#39;s Annual Reports,&nbsp;Board of Trustees meeting minutes, yearbooks, photographs, and other resources related to the history of the College. College publications include Middlesex Now and This Month @ Middlesex.</p>

